WEBVTT

00:08.050 --> 00:10.360
He’s an amazing person.

00:10.360 --> 00:13.290
Wasn’t he a former Prime Minister?

00:14.450 --> 00:17.770
I need to go over my stuff again!

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:52.340 --> 01:54.630
Hey, miss!

01:54.630 --> 01:56.640
Want to have some fun with us?

01:57.370 --> 01:58.920
Stop!

01:58.920 --> 02:01.010
Someone! Someone!

02:03.980 --> 02:05.780
Are you OK, miss?

02:05.780 --> 02:10.190
It would be wrong to let two rats
destroy such a beautiful flower.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.410
D-Damn you!

02:12.410 --> 02:14.120
Who are you?

02:14.120 --> 02:15.600
Me?

02:15.600 --> 02:17.240
I am...

02:19.540 --> 02:22.690
The Wild Prime Minister Takasu Naoyuki

02:23.960 --> 02:26.000
Takasu Naoyuki Changes the World of Politics!!

02:28.880 --> 02:31.940
<i>This is Ayako’s grandfather?</i>

02:34.510 --> 02:38.490
<i>Takasu Naoyuki, born and raised on a farm in Kanto,</i>

02:38.490 --> 02:40.800
<i>worked at the Tokyo Police before his start in politics.</i>

02:41.200 --> 02:43.770
<i>Famous for his ambition, popularity, and cunning,</i>

02:43.770 --> 02:45.550
<i>he rose to Prime Minister.</i>

02:46.190 --> 02:50.570
<i>Even post-retirement, he maintains massive influence
over government bureaucracy and large corporations,</i>

02:50.570 --> 02:52.910
<i>and spends his days making secret deals...</i>

02:54.640 --> 02:57.390
<i>And he’s coming.</i>

03:01.830 --> 03:06.470
Now arriving at our final stop,
Beatrice University High School,

03:06.470 --> 03:09.740
Beatrice University High School.

03:10.830 --> 03:15.850
The Wild Prime Minister Is Here?!

03:17.710 --> 03:18.800
Ayako-san?

03:19.690 --> 03:21.260
I have to talk to you...

03:21.550 --> 03:23.650
A-Are you OK?

03:24.370 --> 03:27.020
I thought about this all night.

03:27.020 --> 03:29.570
But I couldn’t come up with an answer...

03:29.570 --> 03:31.030
Is this about your grandfather?

03:31.030 --> 03:34.080
He’s coming back next Monday, isn’t he?

03:34.080 --> 03:36.370
I heard he’s coming to see the school, too.

03:36.370 --> 03:37.770
What about it?

03:37.770 --> 03:41.160
M-My grandfather still doesn’t know...

03:41.160 --> 03:43.540
What? Out With It!

03:41.720 --> 03:44.460
about me and Mamoru...

03:44.460 --> 03:45.890
I see.

03:45.890 --> 03:47.810
I know your grandfather.

03:47.810 --> 03:51.350
If he knew, it would be a really big deal.

03:53.130 --> 03:55.600
Parade across Japan, maybe?

03:55.600 --> 03:58.620
Or maybe he’d build a castle for the two of you?

03:59.530 --> 04:02.680
Or maybe he’d try to tell the entire universe about you.

04:03.680 --> 04:07.500
I know I should introduce you to him, but...

04:09.200 --> 04:17.240
But I don’t know what trouble it will cause
for you, Itsumi, and your mother.

04:17.240 --> 04:19.360
Don’t worry about me.

04:20.550 --> 04:27.080
But I do want to say hello to him,
and I’d like you to introduce me.

04:31.390 --> 04:33.880
Please... Mamoru...

04:33.880 --> 04:35.630
Just this time...

04:37.560 --> 04:39.380
If that’s what you want.

04:40.890 --> 04:42.070
Thank you...

04:43.180 --> 04:44.510
I’m sorry.

04:45.430 --> 04:51.440
I can do it, but I don’t know if the
rest of the school can hide it.

04:52.090 --> 04:54.250
I got the message, too!

04:54.250 --> 04:59.170
If I say one word about Takasu Ayako and
Yoshimura Mamoru dating

04:59.170 --> 05:02.040
before end of class next Monday,
I’ll be hung from Lindgren Tower!

05:02.040 --> 05:05.050
If I don’t send this e-mail to five people within the hour,

05:05.050 --> 05:06.240
I’ll incur a terrifying curse!

05:06.240 --> 05:07.430
It’s a curse!

05:07.430 --> 05:10.440
It’s a curse from the Witch Beatrice!

05:11.100 --> 05:13.060
From: The Demon of East-B
If the reader of this e-mail
says a word about Ayako Takasu
and Yoshimura Mamoru dating
before the end of class next Monday...

05:11.100 --> 05:13.040
From: The Demon of East-B

05:11.100 --> 05:13.040
Takasu and Yoshimura Mamoru dating
before the end of class next Monday...

05:11.100 --> 05:13.040
If the reader of this e-mail says a word about Ayako

05:13.540 --> 05:17.150
I tried spreading that rumor over the net, too.

05:17.150 --> 05:19.180
Now you don’t need to worry.

05:19.180 --> 05:20.500
Um, guys...

05:20.500 --> 05:23.500
So we can continue this over lunch.

05:23.500 --> 05:25.010
Come on, Ayako-san.

05:25.010 --> 05:26.140
See you.

05:28.180 --> 05:30.650
Let’s hurry, Mamoru.

05:32.990 --> 05:36.560
<i>Ayako didn’t look happy about lying.</i>

05:37.980 --> 05:39.190
<i>For my sake...</i>

05:43.610 --> 05:45.120
I’m sorry.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.000
Are you OK?

05:46.000 --> 05:48.780
Are you all right?

05:48.780 --> 05:52.250
A moment’s mistake can determine
the outcome of the game.

05:52.250 --> 05:54.560
Be careful, young boy.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.500
Thank you.

05:58.800 --> 06:00.340
What’s wrong, young boy?

06:03.980 --> 06:05.260
Is something wrong?

06:06.040 --> 06:07.920
Y-Yoshimura?

06:07.920 --> 06:10.590
What? You know him, Kikukawa?

06:13.510 --> 06:15.430
Ayako!

06:15.430 --> 06:16.890
Grandfather, why?

06:21.250 --> 06:23.570
I changed my plans again.

06:23.570 --> 06:25.010
Once again without telling me...

06:25.010 --> 06:27.670
Don’t worry about it.

06:27.670 --> 06:31.160
But anyway, you’ve gotten bigger since I last saw you.

06:31.750 --> 06:34.630
Your breasts are growing right on schedule.

06:34.630 --> 06:36.540
Good to see, good to see.

06:36.540 --> 06:38.820
Aw, Grandfather!

06:40.880 --> 06:44.480
I’m sure my granddaughter causes
all kinds of problems for you.

06:44.480 --> 06:46.620
Please take care of her...

06:46.620 --> 06:50.220
Ayako... Ayako’s being overpowered.

06:50.220 --> 06:51.700
Unbelievable.

06:51.700 --> 06:53.720
Is he a lion tamer?

06:53.720 --> 06:55.890
Animal Kingdom!

06:55.890 --> 06:58.560
For now, one shot!

07:03.070 --> 07:05.400
Ayako-san looks happy.

07:05.400 --> 07:08.930
Naoyuki-san raised her.

07:09.660 --> 07:14.310
Naoyuki-san and Masaki-san were her family.

07:14.310 --> 07:17.510
By the way, Maya-boy and Miss Shione.

07:17.510 --> 07:18.680
Yes?

07:18.680 --> 07:20.060
What is it, Grandfather?

07:20.060 --> 07:23.380
Has Ayako found a boyfriend?

07:24.130 --> 07:26.650
G-Grandfather, what are you...

07:26.650 --> 07:28.410
You’re at that age.

07:28.410 --> 07:30.450
And with your beauty,

07:30.450 --> 07:32.760
it’s a natural concern.

07:32.760 --> 07:34.550
Well, everyone?

07:34.550 --> 07:40.910
She’s too embarrassed to tell me the truth.

07:41.600 --> 07:46.740
There is no truth. I don’t...

07:46.740 --> 07:50.410
Grandfather, do you think the
Witch Beatrice would get

07:50.410 --> 07:53.690
up early every morning to make
lunch for her boyfriend?

07:53.690 --> 07:55.830
Do you think that’s possible?

07:57.050 --> 07:58.760
Or make a handmade sweater?

07:58.760 --> 07:59.580
Sweater!

07:59.580 --> 08:02.770
Or get all nervous when she
meets her boyfriend’s family?

08:02.770 --> 08:03.830
All nervous!

08:03.830 --> 08:06.640
Or hold hands and hum a song?

08:06.640 --> 08:08.340
“I am a flower child!”

08:08.820 --> 08:12.010
Or use the School Fair’s play as an excuse to kiss him?

08:12.010 --> 08:13.090
Kiss!

08:13.090 --> 08:16.350
Can you imagine that?

08:16.750 --> 08:18.740
I-I can’t, no...

08:18.740 --> 08:19.810
Then, as I thought...

08:19.810 --> 08:24.140
No one in the world has the guts to date her.

08:24.140 --> 08:26.740
No one!

08:27.990 --> 08:30.820
I see... Come to think of it.

08:34.130 --> 08:37.920
So there I was, surrounded by ten enemies!

08:34.130 --> 08:39.170
Special Lecture
Former Prime
Minister
Takasu Naoyuki

08:37.920 --> 08:42.500
However, I saw a moment’s opening and...

08:44.720 --> 08:46.870
What is this?

08:46.870 --> 08:49.850
Naoyuki-san insisted.

08:49.850 --> 08:51.990
He’s so selfish...

08:51.990 --> 08:53.180
Now, now...

08:56.170 --> 08:57.400
I’m sorry.

08:57.910 --> 09:00.120
This will work.

09:00.120 --> 09:03.330
Next time, I’ll introduce you, OK?

09:03.330 --> 09:04.060
Right.

09:07.620 --> 09:12.800
Oh, right... Yesterday, I met the Prussian Devil.

09:13.800 --> 09:16.670
He was most impressed by you.

09:17.590 --> 09:23.790
I did hear one interesting thing while I was there.

09:23.790 --> 09:27.670
I don’t understand, I really don’t.

09:28.070 --> 09:35.290
He said that my niece, Takasu Ayako, had a boyfriend!

09:35.890 --> 09:39.870
And that it was a student here!

09:39.870 --> 09:46.020
But Ayako, and Ayako’s friends, tell me she doesn’t!

09:46.020 --> 09:48.070
What is this?

09:49.630 --> 09:53.920
Unfortunately, I didn’t get the name,

09:53.920 --> 09:56.890
but if they’re here, I’d like them to come forward!

09:56.890 --> 10:00.260
Or perhaps someone could tell me?

10:02.400 --> 10:04.160
Ayako-san!

10:04.150 --> 10:06.060
The curse... The curse!

10:06.060 --> 10:08.530
Hung from Lindgren Tower...

10:08.530 --> 10:10.760
Now then, who is it?

10:10.760 --> 10:11.600
Who?

10:11.600 --> 10:13.000
Who? Who?

10:13.630 --> 10:15.670
I...

10:14.020 --> 10:15.670
It’s me!

10:16.590 --> 10:19.600
Give me the spotlight!

10:19.600 --> 10:27.550
Abiko Tsuneo Ayako LOVE

10:20.100 --> 10:22.020
Hello, Grandfather!

10:22.020 --> 10:23.940
I am Ayako-san’s boyfriend,

10:23.940 --> 10:28.810
the prince of beatrice, Abiko Tsuneo!

10:31.150 --> 10:32.860
Shut up, peasants!

10:32.860 --> 10:34.590
This is fate!

10:34.590 --> 10:40.140
I am the one Ayako-san is fated for,
the one worthy of her!

10:42.390 --> 10:45.460
I like him!

10:51.570 --> 10:53.030
Abiko Tsuneo.

10:53.030 --> 10:55.770
Transferred last June into Basics Class 1, year 2.

10:56.550 --> 10:58.720
I see. He’s a transfer student, too.

10:58.720 --> 11:02.210
If only I could be that dumb...

11:02.830 --> 11:04.600
No, nothing.

11:04.600 --> 11:06.040
Is this OK?

11:06.040 --> 11:07.310
Your grandfather...

11:07.310 --> 11:08.480
It’s no good.

11:08.920 --> 11:10.860
N-No!

11:10.860 --> 11:13.820
There’s nothing between us at all!

11:13.820 --> 11:15.160
Grandfather!

11:15.160 --> 11:17.280
I understand.

11:17.280 --> 11:19.000
Don’t be so nervous.

11:19.590 --> 11:21.690
If I’d known this would happen...

11:22.580 --> 11:24.410
Big news!

11:24.410 --> 11:25.550
What is it?

11:25.550 --> 11:29.120
Her grandfather’s having a party tomorrow to

11:29.120 --> 11:30.970
announce Ayako and Abiko’s engagement!

11:30.970 --> 11:33.210
He’s in the teacher’s room right now, talking to them.

11:35.450 --> 11:37.000
Mamoru!

11:40.100 --> 11:40.840
Um...

11:42.030 --> 11:46.990
Ayako’s friend, Yoshimura Mamoru-kun, yes...

11:46.990 --> 11:48.670
Actually...

11:48.670 --> 11:53.900
I hope you can come to their
engagement party tomorrow.

11:54.630 --> 11:56.700
N-No, you see...

11:57.160 --> 12:01.130
He’s a very unique and active young boy.

12:01.130 --> 12:03.250
Perfect for Ayako.

12:03.250 --> 12:04.550
Yes.

12:04.550 --> 12:05.730
Listen to me.

12:05.730 --> 12:07.120
There’s a reason for this.

12:07.120 --> 12:08.620
Actually... Actually—

12:08.620 --> 12:10.240
Stop right there.

12:11.370 --> 12:13.970
There are no do overs in life.

12:13.970 --> 12:18.590
Miss a chance, and it may never return.

12:19.090 --> 12:24.190
You let your chance pass, young boy.

12:28.580 --> 12:29.580
Goodbye.

12:30.030 --> 12:31.610
Yoshimura...

12:31.610 --> 12:33.490
What’s wrong, Kikukawa?

12:35.790 --> 12:36.900
Grandfather...

12:37.340 --> 12:38.500
Mamoru?

12:38.500 --> 12:39.850
What’s wrong?

12:39.850 --> 12:42.230
What happened with my grandfather?

12:45.520 --> 12:46.490
Grandfather.

12:47.150 --> 12:48.420
Grandfather!

12:56.060 --> 12:57.340
Mamoru...

13:14.080 --> 13:15.910
Up all night again?

13:15.910 --> 13:19.450
I told my grandfather the truth.

13:19.450 --> 13:20.180
And?

13:20.840 --> 13:23.330
He said he won’t cancel the party.

13:23.330 --> 13:27.870
If I try to run, he’ll show no mercy to Mamoru...

13:27.870 --> 13:30.130
He won’t let me contact him, either.

13:30.690 --> 13:32.580
What about you guys?

13:37.720 --> 13:38.880
Delicious!

13:39.260 --> 13:42.960
We helped get the place ready and sent out invitations.

13:42.960 --> 13:45.740
We can’t miss out on something this fun.

13:45.740 --> 13:47.270
That’s right.

13:47.270 --> 13:50.550
We sent an invitation to Mamoru-kun, too.

13:51.490 --> 13:52.680
Do you think he’ll come?

13:54.680 --> 13:55.650
Mamoru!

13:56.600 --> 14:01.350
L-L-Look at this!

14:01.350 --> 14:02.960
What’s wrong, Itsumi?

14:04.860 --> 14:06.650
Announcing the engagement of
Abiko Tsuneo

14:06.650 --> 14:08.130
Wh-What is this?

14:08.130 --> 14:11.140
A-A-Ayako-san, M-Mamoru!

14:13.570 --> 14:15.240
Excuse me.

14:17.500 --> 14:20.110
I don’t see Yoshimura.

14:20.110 --> 14:21.630
I see.

14:24.750 --> 14:26.520
This isn’t like you.

14:26.520 --> 14:28.350
This is different.

14:28.350 --> 14:30.970
Because it’s Naoyuki-san?

14:30.970 --> 14:33.720
It’s my fault for lying.

14:33.720 --> 14:34.700
And...

14:35.230 --> 14:36.130
And?

14:36.800 --> 14:39.560
If I lose my grandfather, too...

14:41.090 --> 14:44.810
Even so, you should say what you’re thinking.

14:44.810 --> 14:46.900
Whatever it may be.

14:48.130 --> 14:49.350
I understand.

14:49.350 --> 14:52.660
I’ll persuade my grandfather by the
end of the party, somehow.

14:52.660 --> 14:56.950
Sometimes you lose your chance
while you’re talking about the future.

14:57.620 --> 15:00.870
Sometimes it ends up being too late...

15:01.320 --> 15:02.810
Aw, that’s a big exaggeration.

15:02.810 --> 15:04.710
It’s just a party.

15:04.710 --> 15:06.020
Miss!

15:06.780 --> 15:08.230
Your grandfather’s calling you.

15:12.640 --> 15:14.760
Grandfather, this...

15:14.760 --> 15:16.380
Why not?

15:16.380 --> 15:17.850
It’s a matter of feeling.

15:17.850 --> 15:18.490
But...

15:26.560 --> 15:28.270
Is this OK?

15:28.270 --> 15:29.610
It’s not, but...

15:30.920 --> 15:34.580
But he said that I lost my chance...

15:34.580 --> 15:36.870
I can’t accept that.

15:37.290 --> 15:39.050
I can’t!

15:39.050 --> 15:43.460
If you don’t have a chance, then make one for yourself!

15:43.460 --> 15:45.740
And Witch Beatrice, too!

15:45.740 --> 15:50.330
I can’t believe she won’t tell your grandfather!

15:50.330 --> 15:54.000
B-But that was for my sake...

15:54.000 --> 15:57.440
Then she should try to protect you, Mamoru!

15:57.440 --> 16:02.730
If she can’t fight them, she should talk
to them until they understand!

16:02.730 --> 16:05.070
Y-Yeah, but...

16:05.070 --> 16:07.050
And you, too!

16:07.050 --> 16:10.600
You didn’t even lose to my brother.

16:10.600 --> 16:13.840
That light you and Witch Beatrice showed me,

16:13.840 --> 16:16.930
what was that?

16:16.930 --> 16:19.390
Was that a lie?

16:19.390 --> 16:21.330
Answer me, Mamoru!

16:28.990 --> 16:32.500
Grandfather, why are you doing all this?

16:32.500 --> 16:36.140
I apologized for lying, so...

16:53.690 --> 16:54.700
Emelenzia!

16:55.240 --> 16:55.870
Right!

16:55.870 --> 16:57.130
Mamoru, hurry!

16:58.450 --> 17:00.900
I’m counting on you, Jirou, Saburou.

17:00.900 --> 17:02.050
On it!

17:02.050 --> 17:04.270
Bro, here’s your chance to show your skills!

17:19.390 --> 17:21.290
Ayako-san!

17:21.290 --> 17:22.990
Come on out...

17:29.830 --> 17:32.480
B-Beautiful!

17:54.380 --> 17:56.000
I’m terribly sorry.

17:56.000 --> 17:58.590
A suspicious car has collided with the front gate.

17:59.020 --> 18:02.970
We ask that the guests not exit the mansion.

18:12.820 --> 18:15.070
Damn it!

18:15.070 --> 18:16.880
Open the door.

18:24.800 --> 18:27.790
Leave us and go, kid!

18:28.420 --> 18:29.950
Thank you, Jirou-san!

18:29.950 --> 18:30.630
Saburou-san!

18:33.760 --> 18:35.670
He came?

18:36.480 --> 18:37.550
Mamoru!

18:47.190 --> 18:48.280
Ayako-san!

18:48.280 --> 18:49.210
Mamoru!

18:50.440 --> 18:51.990
Intruder!

18:51.990 --> 18:53.850
Get him!

18:56.070 --> 18:58.320
I apologize for the interruption.

18:58.940 --> 19:00.030
Grandfather Naoyuki,

19:00.030 --> 19:03.790
Washbasin
Remote Control

19:00.700 --> 19:03.790
The East-B University High School Student Council

19:03.790 --> 19:06.330
will be taking over for a short while.

19:06.830 --> 19:10.060
Air gun

19:10.420 --> 19:13.680
We have a message for you.

19:15.370 --> 19:16.300
President...

19:16.710 --> 19:18.300
Go, Mamoru-kun.

19:18.300 --> 19:21.820
Tell him everything you feel.

19:22.920 --> 19:23.550
Yes!

19:26.430 --> 19:28.390
Takasu Naoyuki-san.

19:28.770 --> 19:31.740
I’m sorry to lie to you.

19:31.740 --> 19:35.130
Regardless of the circumstances, I shouldn’t have done it.

19:35.130 --> 19:37.740
Ayako-san was worried about me.

19:37.740 --> 19:38.470
But I...

19:38.470 --> 19:41.610
I should have made her feel better.

19:41.610 --> 19:42.530
Mamoru.

19:42.970 --> 19:48.660
I’m not much, but I promise to make her happy!

19:48.660 --> 19:51.630
I’ll ask as many times as it takes to get your approval!

19:51.630 --> 19:52.410
So...

19:52.920 --> 19:56.680
No, you’re not actually getting married now.

19:57.530 --> 19:58.300
Now, now.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.980
Grandfather...

20:03.040 --> 20:08.120
No matter what you try to do, I’ll protect Mamoru.

20:08.120 --> 20:11.520
Even if it means disobeying you.

20:11.520 --> 20:17.560
But I’m sure you’ll understand what
kind of person he is.

20:17.560 --> 20:20.170
So please forgive us.

20:20.920 --> 20:23.380
I love Ayako-san!

20:23.380 --> 20:26.890
I love Mamoru!

20:35.340 --> 20:38.700
No reward without risk.

20:38.700 --> 20:43.910
You cannot attack without getting
inside the enemy’s range.

20:44.860 --> 20:47.160
You got your chance, young boy.

20:47.640 --> 20:51.990
I heard about you from Johan, and I knew
everything from the beginning.

20:52.740 --> 20:55.940
Take care of Ayako.

20:57.770 --> 20:58.820
Right!

21:03.580 --> 21:05.820
Let’s take a photo to remember this by!

21:05.820 --> 21:06.910
Pose!

21:14.370 --> 21:17.140
Tired...

21:17.140 --> 21:19.760
You came for us, boss.

21:19.760 --> 21:22.710
Good work, Jirou, Saburou.

21:22.710 --> 21:25.700
No, it was nothing!

21:27.770 --> 21:32.840
That’s right... Why don’t we hold a wedding for them!

21:33.360 --> 21:34.470
That sounds fun!

21:34.470 --> 21:35.200
Agreed!

21:35.200 --> 21:36.980
Let’s party!

21:36.980 --> 21:38.420
<i>Why, I wonder.</i>

21:39.360 --> 21:41.980
<i>Why do I...</i>

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:14.990 --> 23:17.550
I open the southern window and look at

23:17.550 --> 23:20.250
the color of the sea, all alone.

23:20.770 --> 23:22.330
Japan is an island nation.

23:22.330 --> 23:25.600
There are eight prefectures that don’t border the sea.

23:25.600 --> 23:28.020
Which ones are they?

23:28.820 --> 23:36.030
Watch out, I might give you a pop quiz on them,

23:36.720 --> 23:39.640
with a kind warning that I have a dangerous scent.

23:39.640 --> 23:42.980
Next time: Watch Out on the Tropical Island!

23:39.640 --> 23:43.980
Watch Out on the Tropical Island
